{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>to wave it</b> in gematria: מוליך ומביא מעלה ומוריד (moving to and fro, raising and lowering). Therefore in the parashah: three times תנופה, and one of them התנופה, and the ה comes to include one more, making four — corresponding to מוליך ומביא to the four winds; and two times תרומה — corresponding to מעלה ומוריד."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:59.967234793Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}